Experience Rested Unit Dies Test
    Events
        Unit - A unit Dies
    Conditions
        ((Killing unit) has buff |cFF00FF00Rested|r ) Equal to True
        ((Killing unit) is A Hero) Equal to True
        InCinematic Equal to False
    Actions
        -------- - --------
        Set VariableSet XP_KillingPlayer = (Player group((Owner of (Killing unit))))
        Set VariableSet XP_KillingUnit = (Killing unit)
        Set VariableSet CV = (Custom value of (Killing unit))
        -------- - --------
        -------- // Disable automatic XP gain --------
        Hero - Disable experience gain for XP_KillingUnit.
        -------- - --------
        -------- Calculate XP gain --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                IsUnitAlive[CV] Equal to True
                XP_OldExperience[CV] Less than (Hero experience of XP_KillingUnit)
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet XP_Difference = ((Real((Hero experience of XP_KillingUnit))) - (Real(XP_OldExperience[CV])))
                -------- Rested XP bonus (50 % more XP) --------
                Set VariableSet XP_Difference = (XP_Difference x 1.50)
                Hero - Add (Integer(XP_Difference)) experience to XP_KillingUnit, Show level-up graphics
                Game - Display to XP_KillingPlayer for 2.00 seconds the text: (Exp Gained After Rested Buff:  + (String(XP_Difference)))
            Else - Actions
        Set VariableSet XP_OldExperience[CV] = (Hero experience of XP_KillingUnit)
        -------- - --------
        -------- Re-enable XP gain afterwards --------
        Hero - Enable experience gain for XP_KillingUnit.
        -------- - --------
